<p nodeId="5852bc9e3b734ef789a655d5209ccdff"><img src="https://km.sankuai.com/api/file/cdn/212068218/217767800?contentType=1&amp;isNewContent=false" name="屏幕快照 2019-11-14 下午7.54.35.png" width="602" height="273" nodeId="8ed7be7256a041f4abc7f8ed54a90efb" /></p>
<h4 nodeId="6f006abb3b4541aea967e0a857cec165">写入格式</h4>
<p nodeId="66b281e8a04e41c38ea1d2eccd446c5e">不同业务的tair因子底层使用同一存储，为了保证键值的唯一性，写入的key格式为："因子名_key值"，</p>
<p nodeId="e35129e68521403e9a6ee46c13c02c43">如图Tair因子的名称为test_tair，key值表达式为userId，对于userid= 69279227的用户，写入缓存的键值为"test_tair_69279227"。</p>
<p nodeId="a75da33fb7554574b177e0294aac8ad3" />
<p nodeId="0888fad9417b4ae4aaabba9255e0f904"><img src="https://km.sankuai.com/api/file/cdn/212068218/213118270?contentType=1&amp;isNewContent=false" name="image.png" width="817" height="243" nodeId="d65501b6cf3144e9974de1ca881d707f" /></p>
<km-note type="note" nodeId="fe1671bbe7114fb8a91af24d82db0a45">
<km-title>写入数据的限制</km-title>
<km-content>
<p nodeId="8d9ceece2ad74f368403bdf499fd39ef">1.Key值不能超过1000字符</p>
<p align="start" nodeId="f6f1e6020f264d82a2b0e7b1f4990730">2.Value值大小不能超过 100K（100K怎么计算，详情👇）</p>
<p align="start" indent="2" nodeId="a49578a321d1402498ffd007c8d17a02"><span color="">1个</span>Byte<span color="">（字节）存储一个西字字符或标点符号或阿拉伯数字。</span><br /><span color="">2个</span>Byte<span color="">（字节）存储一个汉字及相应标点符号。</span><br /><span color="">100K</span>Byte<span color="">=（100*1024）=102400个西文。</span><br /><span color="">100KByte=（100*1024）/2=51200个汉字</span></p>
</km-content>
</km-note>
<h2 nodeId="1364444318e84fb09aaabe84c29fde77">2、读数据</h2>
<h3 nodeId="c2e758204ee04728a6a5c36cf0de70a5">【Tair因子配置】</h3>
<p nodeId="07c68fbb303543798ae79b3627e76742"><strong>首页--&gt;规则--&gt; 因子</strong></p>
<p nodeId="3912ede5e64f4e5092dc53c4ca8aa46c"><img src="https://km.sankuai.com/api/file/cdn/212068218/212069849?contentType=1&amp;isNewContent=false" name="image.png" width="202" height="287" nodeId="fd7d8876d1ee4d35967c8c632d8b996c" /><img src="https://km.sankuai.com/api/file/cdn/212068218/212069995?contentType=1&amp;isNewContent=false" name="image.png" width="744" height="285" nodeId="464fbe703be440a9b27d5b08e5d6c651" /></p>
<p nodeId="a5aa82f8144f4320a3cddab1d1c671c3" />
<p nodeId="d3ce1aa56af84c0d88d04cb905c3a990">key表达式：aviator表达式，表达式配置支持参数和表达式因子；</p>
<p nodeId="0410eb685b5f49f38bc58f119288030e">存储名称：当前只有一个集群，自行写数据的业务请先与Zeus确认数据存储名称，通过Tatooine写入的数据请与Tatooine确认存储名称；</p>
<p nodeId="798660d00f7c42e5a2cc95fc175d5162">结果类型：请确保写入的数据类型保持一致；</p>
<p nodeId="42db3c72db494e38b78cc06c80f1cb54" />
